OL,3,GNEWSACall to backdate law change to    
OL,4,Akiller parents' rights                 
OL,6,FSurvivors and campaigners are in       
OL,7,FWestminster urging MPs to backdate     
OL,8,FJade's Law, new legislation coming into
OL,9,Fforce in December that automatically   
OL,10,Fsuspends parental rights after a       
OL,11,Fdomestic murder.                       
OL,13,FJade's Law was campaigned for by the   
OL,14,Ffamily of Jade Ward, who was 27 when   
OL,15,Fshe was murdered by ex-partner Russell 
OL,16,FMarsh in Flintshire, Wales, in 2021.   
OL,18,FCurrently, the rules won't apply to    
OL,19,Fcases before the legislation comes into
OL,20,Fforce in December - but an Oxfordshire 
OL,21,Fcharity is calling for that to be      
OL,22,Fchanged.                               
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
