OL,3,GNEWSACall to backdate law change to    
OL,4,Akiller parents' rights                 
OL,6,FJake Richards, the Minister for        
OL,7,FSentencing, Human Rights and           
OL,8,FTechnology, said the new law would     
OL,9,F"help ensure children's safety and     
OL,10,Fwelfare come first".                   
